# CODEOWNERS — review policy for the app-map (07 §7).
#
# Replace @ORG/platform-team with the GitHub team that owns the map, e.g. @acme/mobile-platform.
# The team must have write access to this repository to be a valid code owner, and branch
# protection on main must require code-owner review for these rules to block merges
# (Settings → Branches → "Require review from Code Owners"). Heal PRs (06 R6) are never
# auto-merged; a human from this team approves them.
#
# 07 §7: promotion to ci_gate needs a reviewer who is not the author; ids.yaml changes that
# flip intent_critical true → false need two approvals (configure via branch protection).

/app-map/                          @ORG/platform-team
/.mcp.json                         @ORG/platform-team
/.claude/                          @ORG/platform-team
/tools/app-map-mcp/                @ORG/platform-team

# Harness glue reviewed by the same team (06 R3: hooks and CI are code).
/.github/workflows/app-map.yml     @ORG/platform-team
/scripts/app-map/                  @ORG/platform-team
/scripts/build-app.sh              @ORG/platform-team
/instrumentation/                  @ORG/platform-team
/.gitattributes                    @ORG/platform-team
/CODEOWNERS                        @ORG/platform-team
